---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="Learn how Arman Homes uses information you choose to share through WhatsApp enquiries and phone calls, and how to ask about your personal data.">
  <PageHero title="Privacy Policy" eyebrow="Your Information" description="A clear explanation of the information used when you contact Arman Homes." />
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap-narrow prose">
    <p class="updated">Last updated: 5 November 2026</p>
    <h2>Who We Are</h2>
    <p>Arman Homes is a real estate agency based in Hinjewadi Marunji, Pune. For questions about your information, contact <a href="mailto:armanhomess@gmail.com">armanhomess@gmail.com</a> or <a href="tel:+919354210824">+91 9354210824</a>.</p>
    <h2>Information You Choose to Share</h2>
    <p>Enquiry forms ask for your name, phone number, enquiry type and message. Seller enquiries also ask for property location, type and details. Project forms include the project name. Please share only what is needed and avoid identity documents, banking details or other sensitive information.</p>
    <h2>How the Enquiry Form Works</h2>
    <p>The website uses your entered details in your browser to create a prefilled WhatsApp message, including the source page address. When you choose to open that message, the enquiry text is included in a link to WhatsApp. Review the text and send it manually in WhatsApp. Opening WhatsApp does not confirm that Arman Homes has received a message.</p>
    <p>Enquiry forms do not use email-delivery services or an email submission endpoint. The public email address remains available for people who choose to write separately using their own email application. Phone links open your device’s calling functionality; you decide whether to place the call.</p>
    <p>WhatsApp handles the handoff and subsequent conversation under its <a href="https://www.whatsapp.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">privacy policy</a>. If WhatsApp cannot open, your entered details stay in the form. You can copy the message, use the direct WhatsApp link or call us.</p>
    <h2>How Your Information Is Used</h2>
    <p>Information you send to Arman Homes is used to respond to your enquiry, understand your property requirements and discuss relevant next steps. Information may need to be shared with relevant service providers to handle that request. Contact us before sharing details you consider sensitive.</p>
    <h2>Website Storage and External Links</h2>
    <p>The current website code does not save enquiry details to browser storage or send them to analytics. It uses session storage to remember whether the introductory loading animation has already appeared. Hosting providers may process technical request information in server logs. The browser and WhatsApp may retain information under their own settings and policies.</p>
    <p>Your details remain in the current form and a prepared WhatsApp link until you edit, reset or leave the page; your browser may restore form values when navigating Back. Copying the message places it on your device’s clipboard. Phone, email, WhatsApp and map links open external services governed by their providers’ policies. Map links show the general confirmed area rather than a precise business address.</p>
    <h2>Retention and Your Requests</h2>
    <p>Contact Arman Homes to ask about information you have sent, request a correction or ask for deletion. The agency can explain what it holds and whether information needs to be retained for an enquiry or related obligations. WhatsApp and other services you choose to use may retain information under their own policies.</p>
    <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>This page may be updated when enquiry handling or services change. The date above reflects the latest update.</p>
  </div></section>
</Layout>
